{"id":"fm-fig-007","s":"further","t":"fp-hyp","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows $y=a\\cosh x-b\\sinh x$ with $a,b>0$, with its y-intercept A and its minimum point M marked. Find the exact $x$-coordinate of M.","o":["$\\ln 2$","$\\ln 9$","$-\\ln 3$","$\\ln 3$"],"a":3,"x":"At A, $y=a=5$. The minimum value at M is 3, and the minimum of $a\\cosh x-b\\sinh x$ is $\\sqrt{a^2-b^2}$, so $b=4$. Then $e^{2x}=\\frac{a+b}{a-b}=9$, so $x=\\ln 3$.","w":["Took $b=3$ (the minimum value) instead of solving $\\sqrt{25-b^2}=3$, which gives $x=\\frac12\\ln 4$.","Solved $e^{2x}=9$ but forgot to halve, giving $\\ln 9$ instead of $\\frac12\\ln 9$.","Inverted the ratio to $\\frac{a-b}{a+b}$, which gives a negative $x$ that cannot match M on the graph.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,2.5],"y":[0,8],"xstep":0.5,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,5.0],[0.015625,4.938108],[0.03125,4.877421],[0.046875,4.817925],[0.0625,4.759606],[0.078125,4.702449],[0.09375,4.646439],[0.109375,4.591564],[0.125,4.53781],[0.140625,4.485164],[0.15625,4.433613],[0.171875,4.383145],[0.1875,4.333746],[0.203125,4.285406],[0.21875,4.238112],[0.234375,4.191852],[0.25,4.146616],[0.265625,4.102393],[0.28125,4.059171],[0.296875,4.01694],[0.3125,3.975689],[0.328125,3.93541],[0.34375,3.896091],[0.359375,3.857723],[0.375,3.820297],[0.390625,3.783804],[0.40625,3.748235],[0.421875,3.713581],[0.4375,3.679834],[0.453125,3.646984],[0.46875,3.615026],[0.484375,3.58395],[0.5,3.553749],[0.515625,3.524415],[0.53125,3.495942],[0.546875,3.468323],[0.5625,3.44155],[0.578125,3.415618],[0.59375,3.390519],[0.609375,3.366248],[0.625,3.342799],[0.640625,3.320167],[0.65625,3.298344],[0.671875,3.277328],[0.6875,3.257111],[0.703125,3.237689],[0.71875,3.219058],[0.734375,3.201213],[0.75,3.184149],[0.765625,3.167863],[0.78125,3.152351],[0.796875,3.137607],[0.8125,3.12363],[0.828125,3.110416],[0.84375,3.097961],[0.859375,3.086262],[0.875,3.075317],[0.890625,3.065122],[0.90625,3.055676],[0.921875,3.046976],[0.9375,3.03902],[0.9531