{"id":"fm-fig-011","s":"further","t":"fp-num","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows an exact solution (Exact) and its Euler's method approximation (Euler). Find the percentage error of the Euler estimate at the right-hand end, relative to the exact value.","o":["12.5%","33.3%","25%","75%"],"a":2,"x":"At the right-hand end, Euler gives 3 (point P) and the exact curve gives 4 (point Q). Error = 4 − 3 = 1. Percentage error = 1 ÷ 4 × 100 = 25%.","w":["Read the gap between the curves as 0.5 instead of 1, misjudging the vertical scale.","Divided the error by the Euler estimate instead of the exact value, giving 1 ÷ 3.","","Found the estimate as a percentage of the exact value (3 ÷ 4) instead of the error."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,2],"y":[0,4],"xstep":0.5,"ystep":0.5,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,0.0],[0.0125,0.000156],[0.025,0.000625],[0.0375,0.001406],[0.05,0.0025],[0.0625,0.003906],[0.075,0.005625],[0.0875,0.007656],[0.1,0.01],[0.1125,0.012656],[0.125,0.015625],[0.1375,0.018906],[0.15,0.0225],[0.1625,0.026406],[0.175,0.030625],[0.1875,0.035156],[0.2,0.04],[0.2125,0.045156],[0.225,0.050625],[0.2375,0.056406],[0.25,0.0625],[0.2625,0.068906],[0.275,0.075625],[0.2875,0.082656],[0.3,0.09],[0.3125,0.097656],[0.325,0.105625],[0.3375,0.113906],[0.35,0.1225],[0.3625,0.131406],[0.375,0.140625],[0.3875,0.150156],[0.4,0.16],[0.4125,0.170156],[0.425,0.180625],[0.4375,0.191406],[0.45,0.2025],[0.4625,0.213906],[0.475,0.225625],[0.4875,0.237656],[0.5,0.25],[0.5125,0.262656],[0.525,0.275625],[0.5375,0.288906],[0.55,0.3025],[0.5625,0.316406],[0.575,0.330625],[0.5875,0.345156],[0.6,0.36],[0.6125,0.375156],[0.625,0.390625],[0.6375,0.406406],[0.65,0.4225],[0.6625,0.438906],[0.675,0.455625],[0.6875,0.472656],[0.7,0.49],[0.7125,0.507656],[0.725,0.525625],[0.7375,0.543906],[0.75,0.5625],[0.7625,0.581406],[0.775,0.600625],[0.7875,0.620156],[0.8,0.64],[0.8125,0.660156],[0.825,0.680625],[0.8375,0.701406],[0.85,0.7225],[0.8625,0.743906],[0.875,0.765625],[0.8875,0.787656],[0.9,0.81],[